  {
   "n": 8,
   "type": "MSQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • Data Science & Artificial Intelligence • +2 / -0",
   "html": "<p>Consider <em>A</em><sub><em>n</em> × <em>m</em></sub> and <em>B</em><sub><em>m</em> × <em>n</em></sub> matrices <em>n</em> < <em>m</em>.<br />\nWhich of the following is/are true?</p>",
   "options": [
